{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "三类价格源",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 126.47,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "换掉现货价，有三类选择。",
   "spoken": "换掉现货价，有三类选择。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "第一类，AMM 的时间加权平均价，简称 TWAP。",
   "spoken": "第一类，AMM 的时间加权平均价，简称 TWAP。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.036,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 5.134,
   "speechEnd": 9.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "它把一段时间里的价格，按时间加权求平均。",
   "spoken": "它把一段时间里的价格，按时间加权求平均。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.536,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 10.634,
   "speechEnd": 14.253
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "一笔交易推高的价格，在平均里只占一小段，几乎不起作用。",
   "spoken": "一笔交易推高的价格，在平均里只占一小段，几乎不起作用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.292,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 15.39,
   "speechEnd": 19.913
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "代价是，窗口越长，价格越滞后。",
   "spoken": "代价是，窗口越常，价格越滞后。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.984,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 21.082,
   "speechEnd": 24.224
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "而低流动性的池子，仍然可以被连续多个区块持续操纵。",
   "spoken": "而低流动性的池子，仍然可以被连续多个区块持续操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.284,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 25.382,
   "speechEnd": 29.643
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "在 PoS 下，同一个提议者连续出块时，这种操纵会更便宜。",
   "spoken": "在 PoS 下，同一个提议者连续出块时，这种操纵会更便宜。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.712,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 30.81,
   "speechEnd": 35.417
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2022 年 4 月的 Inverse Finance，就是这样。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 4 月的 Inverse Finance，就是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.476,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 36.574,
   "speechEnd": 39.824
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "攻击者没有用闪电贷。他投入自有资金，持续推高浅池里的 INV 价格。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没有用闪电贷。他投入自有资金，持续推高浅池里的 INV 价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.896,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 40.994,
   "speechEnd": 46.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "同时用垃圾交易抑制套利，让 TWAP 输出虚高的价格。",
   "spoken": "同时用垃圾交易抑制套利，让 TWAP 输出虚高的价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.548,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 47.646,
   "speechEnd": 52.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "按公开报道，借走约 1560 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按公开报道，借走约 1560 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 53.288,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 53.386,
   "speechEnd": 56.909
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "TWAP 挡得住一笔交易，挡不住有资本的多区块操纵。",
   "spoken": "TWAP 挡得住一笔交易，挡不住有资本的多区块操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.972,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 58.07,
   "speechEnd": 62.439
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "第二类，链下聚合预言机，比如 Chainlink。",
   "spoken": "第二类，链下聚合预言机，比如 Chainlink。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 63.496,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 63.594,
   "speechEnd": 67.01
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "价格在链下聚合，再写上链。一笔交易改不动它。",
   "spoken": "价格在链下聚合，再写上链。一笔交易改不动它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 68.06,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 68.158,
   "speechEnd": 72.369
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "它按心跳和偏离阈值更新。",
   "spoken": "它按心跳和偏离阈值更新。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 73.416,
   "dur": 3.048,
   "speechStart": 73.514,
   "speechEnd": 75.633
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "心跳，是价格不变时，也必须更新的最长间隔。",
   "spoken": "心跳，是价格不变时，也必须更新的最常间隔。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 76.684,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 76.782,
   "speechEnd": 80.913
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "它的风险换了方向：价格可能过时，可能撞上上下限，节点和喂价方也可能失效。",
   "spoken": "它的风险换了方向：价格可能过时，可能撞上上下限，节点和喂价方也可能失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 81.968,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 82.066,
   "speechEnd": 88.518
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "第三类，多源组合。几个价格源互相比较，偏离超过阈值就暂停。",
   "spoken": "第三类，多源组合。几个价格源互相比较，偏离超过阈值就暂停。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 89.58,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 89.678,
   "speechEnd": 95.473
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "它更稳，但实现复杂。几个源意见不一时听谁的，要提前想好。",
   "spoken": "它更稳，但实现复杂。几个源意见不一时听谁的，要提前想好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 96.544,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 96.642,
   "speechEnd": 102.175
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "顺带一句，LP 代币也不能按储备乘现货价来定价。",
   "spoken": "顺带一句，LP 代币也不能按储备乘现货价来定价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 103.244,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 103.342,
   "speechEnd": 107.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "要用外部预言机的价格和不变量，反推出公平储备，再算 LP 的价值。",
   "spoken": "要用外部预言机的价格和不变量，反推出公平储备，再算 LP 的价值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 108.6,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 108.698,
   "speechEnd": 113.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "没有完美的预言机。",
   "spoken": "没有完美的预言机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-21.mp3",
   "start": 114.964,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 115.062,
   "speechEnd": 116.407
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "工程上要回答两个问题。",
   "spoken": "工程上要回答两个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-22.mp3",
   "start": 117.464,
   "dur": 2.808,
   "speechStart": 117.562,
   "speechEnd": 119.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-23",
   "text": "价格错了，会怎样？价格停了，会怎样？",
   "spoken": "价格错了，会怎样？价格停了，会怎样？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg4-23.mp3",
